# K0 semantic challenge round 2: 5 frozen NON_NORMATIVE samples. Round 1 drew no NN record because its pool asked for HIGH confidence and every NN record here is MEDIUM.
1 UPHELD | The hook's reach, reported as a gap; no duty.
2 UPHELD | A parser limit, reported; the checks that use the parser are read at their own records.
3 UPHELD | A reported gap in where the force instruction applies. The denial and its instruction are read at their own records; read statically (C10).
4 UPHELD | A fact about when a rule file loads; it prescribes no routing.
5 UPHELD | A reported suppression of a reminder; the reminder is read at its own record.
